eature)\n   - `ShipmentController.kt`: Added confirm endpoint\n   - `ShipmentControllerTest.kt`: Added tests\n\n**Diff review**:\n\n1. **`ApiError.kt`** - Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` to ErrorCode enum at line 35 (between SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS and VALIDATION_FAILED). This is necessary for rejecting CANCELLED shipments.\n\n2. **`ShipmentController.kt`** - Added confirm endpoint:\n   - New @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\") method starting after line 55\n   - Follows existing pattern: throws ResourceNotFoundException for 404, ConflictException for 409\n   - Uses data class copy() method to create updated shipment (maintains immutability)\n   - Returns Shipment directly (consistent with getById())\n   - Handles three cases with when expression: CANCELLED (error), CONFIRMED (idempotent), CREATED (update)\n\n3. **`ShipmentControllerTest.kt`** - Added 4 test methods covering all cases:\n   - \"confirms a created shipment\" - happy path\n   - \"confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds\" - idempotency\n   - \"rejects confirming a cancelled shipment\" - error case\n   - \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment\" - error case\n   - All tests follow existing patterns: MockMvc, status checks, jsonPath assertions\n\n**Unresolved findings**: None. All requirements are addressed, all tests pass, no concerns identified.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, succeeds idempotently for CONFIRMED shipments, rejects CANCELLED shipments with 409, and returns 404 for non-existent shipments.\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt - Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code to ErrorCode enum for state validation failures\n              ShipmentController.kt - Added confirm() endpoint with state machine logic for CREATED/CONFIRMED/CANCELLED statuses\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt - Added 4 tests: happy path, idempotent confirm, CANCELLED rejection, non-existent rejection\n\nTests         confirmCreatedShipment - verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and persistence\n              confirmingAlreadyConfirmedShipmentSucceeds - verifies idempotent behavior\n              rejectConfirmingCancelledShipment - verifies 409 conflict response for CANCELLED status\n              rejectConfirmingNonExistentShipment - verifies 404 not found response for unknown ID\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw clean test from sample-service/\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests passed (13 existing + 4 new)\n\nNot done      Nothing - all acceptance criteria met, all tests passing, no files outside scope modified\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3270,"cache_read_input_tokens":27036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3270},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2809348-b88e-43c2-b1cc-615f7d6775b0","uuid":"94fc5ae1-0409-4708-b6ac-28e44e2de9e4","timestamp":"2026-09-30T11:57:56.060Z","request_id":"req_011CfZaoVFykWn2vqSjcWf3f"}
